; msl-dump-probe.fk — print the MSL the qwen35 dense path emits, so the op
; census is counted rather than remembered.
;
; Two guesses died against this dump on 2026-08-24 and both were mine:
; that the `_off` matvec variants were the plain ones with an offset bolted on
; (they are — but no two emitted bodies actually merge under that transform),
; and that the four kernels present-but-never-piped for qwen35 were dead
; (they are the shared library's other tenants — llama, kat-exit, kat-block0).
;
;   ./fkwu observe/msl-dump-probe.fk > /tmp/q38.msl
;
; preludes: native/metal/qwen35-dense-token-handle.fk

(do (print (q38-msl)) 0)
